        <PostBuildEvent><![CDATA[echo Steamworks post-build: $(Platform) $(Config), copying steam_api64.dll to $(OUTPUTDIR)
copy /Y "$(PROJECTDIR)\..\..\redistributable_bin\win64\steam_api64.dll" "$(OUTPUTDIR)" || (echo ERROR: could not copy steam_api64.dll from redistributable_bin\win64\ - if it is missing, copy redistributable_bin from the Steamworks SDK 1.65 into the repository root, then run tools\check_redist.py & exit /b 1)
